  "description": "\"Goddess Yakran! You will love the man you cursed!\" When Goddess Yakran curses a human for betraying her, she is punished by the Emperor of the Heavens to be reborn as a human slave. During her life as the palace slave \"Ari\", she happens to meet the very prince she cursed. Will they find true love and break the curse they are in?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nChapters: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3713079)  \nVolumes: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=9337037), [Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list?novelId=765208)\n\n**Official English:**  \n[Lalatoon](https://lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7098), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/my_goddess)",
